From ef3d5eaf345e349e843887ec16602554bd77c206 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 16:52:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] MAINTAINERS: add the HiSilicon STB display driver entry

The HiSTB display pipeline has no maintainer entry. The DRM driver, the
SiI9134 transmitter glue and both bindings are reviewed as one unit
through dri-devel.

Register the DRM directory, the bridge driver and the VDP and HDMI
bindings.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
---
 MAINTAINERS | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

--- a/MAINTAINERS
+++ b/MAINTAINERS
@@ -8354,6 +8354,17 @@ T:	git https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/dr
 F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/himax,hx8394.yaml
 F:	drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-himax-hx8394.c
 
+DRM DRIVER FOR HISILICON STB VDP2 AND HDMI TRANSMITTER
+M:	David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
+L:	dri-devel@lists.freedesktop.org
+S:	Supported
+F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/bridge/hisilicon,hi3798mv100-hdmi.yaml
+F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/hisilicon/hisilicon,hi3716cv200-vdp.yaml
+F:	drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/hi3798mv100-hdmi.c
+F:	drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/sii9134.c
+F:	drivers/gpu/drm/bridge/sii9134.h
+F:	drivers/gpu/drm/histb/
+
 DRM DRIVER FOR HX8357D PANELS
 S:	Orphan
 T:	git https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/drm/misc/kernel.git
